{
  "id": "database/d1",
  "title": "Cloudflare D1",
  "description": "A D1 binding (SQLite on Cloudflare) and the `@repo/db` package.",
  "docs": "https://github.com/amagdy46/efforge/blob/main/docs/addons/database-d1.md",
  "files": [
    {
      "path": "files/package.json",
      "target": "packages/db/package.json"
    },
    {
      "path": "files/tsconfig.json",
      "target": "packages/db/tsconfig.json"
    }
  ],
  "dependencies": {
    "apps/web": [
      "@repo/db"
    ],
    "packages/db": [
      "@repo/core",
      "@effect/sql-d1",
      "effect",
      "effect-cf"
    ],
    "packages/core": [
      "@effect/sql-d1"
    ]
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "packages/db": [
      "@cloudflare/workers-types",
      "@types/node",
      "typescript",
      "wrangler"
    ],
    "packages/core": [
      "@cloudflare/workers-types"
    ]
  },
  "envVars": [],
  "requires": [],
  "conflicts": [],
  "transforms": [
    {
      "name": "addWranglerBinding",
      "args": {
        "key": "d1_databases",
        "value": "{\"binding\": \"DB\", \"database_name\": \"app\", \"database_id\": \"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\", \"migrations_dir\": \"packages/db/migrations\"}"
      },
      "when": {
        "infra": [
          "none"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "addAlchemyResource",
      "args": {
        "name": "database",
        "code": "const database = yield* Cloudflare.D1.Database(\"Database\", {\n  migrations: \"packages/db/drizzle\",\n})",
        "binding": "DB"
      },
      "when": {
        "infra": [
          "alchemy"
        ],
        "orm": [
          "drizzle"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "addAlchemyResource",
      "args": {
        "name": "database",
        "code": "const database = yield* Cloudflare.D1.Database(\"Database\", {\n  migrations: \"packages/db/migrations\",\n})",
        "binding": "DB"
      },
      "when": {
        "infra": [
          "alchemy"
        ],
        "orm": [
          "effect-sql"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "appendAgentsSection",
      "args": {
        "id": "database",
        "content": "## Database (Cloudflare D1)\n\n- The Worker reaches D1 only through the `DB` binding (`packages/db/src/layer.ts`, through effect-cf). D1 is SQLite: write SQLite SQL, and keep each query small (a Worker request has a time limit)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "appendAgentsSection",
      "args": {
        "id": "database-wrangler",
        "content": "- `DB` is declared under `d1_databases` in `wrangler.jsonc`. `pnpm db:migrate` applies `packages/db/migrations/` to the local D1 in `.wrangler/state` (shared with `pnpm dev`; delete it to start empty), and `pnpm db:migrate --remote` to the deployed one."
      },
      "when": {
        "infra": [
          "none"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "appendAgentsSection",
      "args": {
        "id": "database-alchemy",
        "content": "- `infra/alchemy.run.ts` declares the D1 database. `pnpm dev` applies the migrations to a local D1 under `.alchemy/`, and `pnpm run deploy` to the stage's database; `pnpm db:migrate` is not used with Alchemy."
      },
      "when": {
        "infra": [
          "alchemy"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "scripts": {
    ".": {
      "db:migrate": "pnpm --filter @repo/db db:migrate"
    }
  }
}
